<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ar" dir="rtl"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>BlinK Delivery - Yami Yami Sushi</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;background:#f7f3ec;color:#2b241c}header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:#fff;padding:12px 4%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;box-shadow:0 2px 12px #0002}.brand{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#6d35d8}button{border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;cursor:pointer;font-size:15px}.hero{padding:25px 4%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff8eb,#f7e8cf);text-align:center}.restaurant-title{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:#7a5424}.hero h1{margin:10px 0 6px;font-size:30px}.hero p{color:#6d6256;font-size:17px}.hero input{width:100%;max-width:650px;padding:14px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:14px;font-size:16px}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto}section:not(.hero){padding:20px 4%}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:16px}.card{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:10px;box-shadow:0 3px 15px #0002;overflow:hidden}.food{height:190px;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5ead7;background-size:cover;background-position:center}.card h3{margin:10px 4px 5px;font-size:18px}.desc{font-size:12px;color:#777;min-height:30px}.price{font-weight:bold;color:#8a5a18;margin:8px 4px}.primary{background:#6d35d8;color:#fff;width:100%}.cart{position:fixed;top:0;right:-420px;width:min(400px,92%);height:100%;background:#fff;z-index:10;padding:25px;box-shadow:-5px 0 20px #0003;transition:.25s;overflow:auto}.cart.open{right:0}.close{float:left;background:#eee}.cart-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}.cart input{width:100%;padding:13px;margin:15px 0;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px}.total{font-size:18px;margin:20px 0}.message{position:fixed;bottom:20px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#222;color:#fff;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:12px;display:none;z-index:20}.message.show{display:block}#cartCount{background:#6d35d8;color:#fff;border-radius:50%;padding:3px 7px}.food.makis{background-image:url("data:image/jpeg;base64,")}
.food.sashimi{background-image:url("data:image/jpeg;base64,")}
.food.boxes{background-image:url("data:image/jpeg;base64,")}
.food.specials{background-image:url("data:image/jpeg;base64,")}
.food.fry{background-image:url("data:image/jpeg;base64,")}
.food.aromaki{background-image:url("data:image/jpeg;base64,")}
.food.boats{background-image:url("data:image/jpeg;base64,")}
.food.assort{background-image:url("data:image/jpeg;base64,")}
.food.california{background-image:url("data:image/jpeg;base64,")}
@media(max-width:520px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.food{height:145px}.card h3{font-size:15px}.price{font-size:14px}.card{padding:8px}.hero h1{font-size:24px}.restaurant-title{font-size:25px}}</style></head><body><header><div class="brand">⚡ BlinK</div><button id="cartBtn">🛒 السلة <span id="cartCount">0</span></button></header><main><section class="hero"><div class="restaurant-title">🍣 Yami Yami Sushi</div><h1>منيو Yami Yami Sushi</h1><p>اختر طلبك من القائمة وأضفه إلى السلة.</p><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="ابحث عن طبق..."></section><section><h2>🍱 الأطباق</h2><div id="products" class="grid"></div></section></main><aside id="cart" class="cart"><button id="closeCart" class="close">✕</button><h2>سلة الطلب</h2><div id="cartItems"></div><div class="total">المجموع: <strong id="total">0</strong> درهم</div><input id="address" placeholder="اكتب عنوان التوصيل"><button id="checkout" class="primary">تأكيد الطلب</button></aside><div id="message" class="message"></div><script>
